[h2]Build 0.9.25[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]One view for everything, matched to the base game.[/b] Kitchen counters, tall kitchen units, wardrobes, cube shelving, bookcases, wall cabinets and swings are now drawn from above in every direction, the way vanilla draws its stove and bookcase. A piece no longer changes shape when you rotate it.
[*][b]Kitchen counters are full depth.[/b] The worktop now covers the tile, with the cabinet showing as a strip along its near edge. The hob has four proper burners and the sink a bigger basin with its tap at the back.
[*][b]Runs read as one piece.[/b] Door gaps are evenly spaced along a run of counters or wardrobes, with no heavier line where two tiles meet.
[*][b]Square corners[/b] on counters, tall units, wardrobes, shelving, bookcases and wall cabinets, like vanilla's.
[*]Sectional backs and arms now show a little height along their near edge.
[/list]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The outline now meets cleanly at the inside corner of an L-shaped or U-shaped sectional, and of conversation pit seating. It used to leave a gap where the two lines should join.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Art only: no gameplay changes. Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
